0004    | OP_GET_INDEX
0005    | OP_RETURN
== apply ==
0000    6 OP_GET_LOCAL        2
0002    | OP_GET_LOCAL        1
0004    | OP_CALL             1
0006    | OP_RETURN
== main ==
0000    9 OP_GET_GLOBAL       0 'first'
0002    | OP_CONSTANT         1 '10'
0004    | OP_CONSTANT         2 '20'
0006    | OP_CONSTANT         3 '30'
0008    | OP_LIST             3
0010    | OP_CALL             1
